perlauncher(6)

# NAME

perlauncher - a desktop launcher and instance manager for Minecraft.

# SYNOPSIS

*perlauncher* [OPTIONS...]

# DESCRIPTION

PerLauncher manages separate Minecraft installations, modloaders, modpacks and Java runtimes.

# OPTIONS

*-d, --dir*=DIRECTORY
	Use DIRECTORY as the launcher root.

*-l, --launch*=INSTANCE_ID
	Launch the instance specified by INSTANCE_ID.

*--show*=INSTANCE_ID
	Show the configuration window of the instance specified by INSTANCE_ID.

*--alive*
	Write a small live-check file after startup.

*-h, --help*
	Display help text and exit.

*-v, --version*
	Display program version and exit.
